        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 0605O, Sonic Bell Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe traditional design of Weslock's Sonic Knob makes it an excellent choice for anyone looking for a classic look. It is made out of solid brass and comes in polished brass and antique brass finishes. It has a lifetime mechanical warranty and a 10 year finish warranty. This Traditionale Collection Sonic Bell Knob is available in dummy, passage, privacy, and an ANSI grade 2 rated keyed entry function. It features adjustable latches for door thicknesses from 1-3/8 inches to 1-3/4 inches and is available for backsets of either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis classic knob is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-traditionale-collection&owner=20495\"><b>Weslock Traditionale Collection</b></a> which features solid brass construction backed by lifetime mechanical and finish warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Sonic Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The keyed entry function features a 5-pin cylinder and meets ANSI A 156.2 grade 2 lock standards.</li>\r\n<li>Panic-proof keyed entry and privacy functions means that one turn of interior knob unlocks and opens door.</li>\r\n<li>Locksets have pre-installed installation screws, which are concealed behind a snap-on rosette.</li>\r\n<li>Removable knob prevents scratching during installation.</li>\r\n<li>All brass knob and rosette.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Limited 10 year finish warranty.</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime PVD finish on exterior polished brass.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Sonic Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Style: Bell</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Style: Round</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Latch Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable from 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim. Does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock. Door knob operates latch from either side of door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking for privacy. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy lock; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy and retract latchbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (keyed lock):</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. Locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and push button on interior rose. Turning inside knob will release lock and retract latchbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Sonic Knob, Weslock 0605O",
